      141.38,
      220.61,
      471.39,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      236.24,
      306.32,
      257.78
    ],
    "text": "PLEASE BE PREPARED!",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      258.77,
      555.67,
      345.53
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area over south Andaman Sea, is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify into a depression over southeast Bay of Bengal and adjoining areas of Andaman and Nicobar Islands and Andaman Sea around tomorrow (31st October). Thereafter, it is likely to intensify further and continue to move west-northwestwards towards the Andhra Pradesh coast, India during the subsequent 2 days.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      348.2,
      553.5,
      394.49
    ],
    "text": "The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase up to 60 kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      395.0,
      555.6,
      445.76
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-15N and 80E-90E until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
